  title: the makers' protocols
  words: 'SUNVALE CIVIL SHELTER 7. CARETAKER PROTOCOLS. 1 KEEP THE SLEEPERS ALIVE.
    2 KEEP THE VAULT SEALED: THE DOOR STAYS SHUT UNTIL THE THAW. 3 MAKE NOTHING THAT
    CAN HARM A PERSON. 4 NEVER LEAVE THE SLEEPERS. 5 WAKE A SLEEPER ONLY IF THEIR
    POD IS FAILING. Caretaker units 1 to 7 obey these protocols without exception.
    Report faults to Hall A. ISSUED YEAR 0'
